Subject: [PATCH prerequisite] Allow root input-management opt-out

Base: a0d399defebd60db30ba38325d9cf47dbda49bee (v26.4.1).
Retains the MIT notices in the modified source. Candidate only: not built,
not installed, not a power-only build and not an authorisation fix.

Set [services] manage_input=false in the root-owned daemon configuration.
Skip both DeckService and DS inhibitor at startup; ignore later inhibitor
commands in RootContext. Existing queued D-Bus acknowledgement is unchanged.
The default remains true. Changing the flag requires restart.

